              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Rides a horse. Has hand weapon, light armour, and buckler. The Standard Bearer may have heavy armour (+1). Other characters may have heavy armour (+1), bow (+4), javelins (+2), kontos (+3) and barding (+4), and may exchange kontos and buckler for throwing or thrusting spear and shield (+1).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
