              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All may use Combined Formation with up to half the unit’s figures exchanging thrusting spear and large shield for composite bow (-2) and forming the rear ranks. Levies are Levies. Isaurians have hand weapon, sling or javelins and buckler. Light Infantry. May have throwing spear (+3) and may exchange buckler for shield (+1).</characteristic>
